WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:07.845
What will life be like in twenty fifty? Here are my predictions. I'm an optimist!

2
00:00:09.295 --> 00:00:12.406
I think robots will do a lot of our jobs.

3
00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:15.317
We'll work only four days a week!

4
00:00:17.567 --> 00:00:20.818
We'll use energy from the sun everywhere.

5
00:00:21.268 --> 00:00:23.497
Cities won't be so polluted.

6
00:00:25.747 --> 00:00:28.766
People will travel to Mars on vacation!

7
00:00:29.216 --> 00:00:32.838
Will it be expensive? Yes, it will!

8
00:00:35.088 --> 00:00:38.525
And people will live to be a hundred and twenty.

9
00:00:38.975 --> 00:00:41.900
My grandparents will be very happy!

10
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:48.562
And you? Do you think life will be better in twenty fifty?

